  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large ovenproof frying pan over medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 5 minutes, stirring, until softened.",
    "Add the garlic and lamb mince. Cook for 6 to 8 minutes, breaking up the meat, until browned and any liquid has mostly evaporated.",
    "Stir in the cumin, paprika, ground coriander, cinnamon, cayenne, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the canned tomatoes, tomato paste, and water. Simmer for 8 to 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until thickened and rich.",
    "Use a spoon to make 4 small wells in the sauce. Crack an egg into each well.",
    "Cover the pan and cook over low heat for 6 to 8 minutes, until the egg whites are set and the yolks are still slightly runny, or transfer to a hot oven for a few minutes if needed.",
    "Scatter over the parsley and serve immediately."
  ],
